# Migrations

SQL files in this directory are embedded in the binary and applied in file name order
when the server starts (see `db.Migrate`). Each file runs once, in its own transaction,
and is recorded in the `schema_migrations` table.

- Name new files `<timestamp>_<description>.sql`, e.g. `20260301120000_add_products_sku.sql`,
  so they sort after existing ones. `goforge add resource` creates one per resource.
- Never edit a migration that has already been applied anywhere; add a new one instead.
